<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.367" end="00:00:02.833">Here are some instruments<br />that begin with the letter &quot;t.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.833" end="00:00:03.867">(makes &quot;t&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.867" end="00:00:06.433">(plays drum roll)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.433" end="00:00:07.867">Tympani.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:07.867" end="00:00:10.333">(plays a few notes)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.333" end="00:00:12.267">Trumpet.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:12.267" end="00:00:14.533">(plays a few notes)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.533" end="00:00:15.667">Trombone.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:15.667" end="00:00:17.033">(plays a note)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:17.033" end="00:00:18.067">Triangle.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:18.067" end="00:00:19.067">(rattles)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:19.067" end="00:00:20.467">Tambourine.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:20.467" end="00:00:23.167">(plays a note)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:23.167" end="00:00:24.600">Tuba.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:24.600" end="00:00:25.300">&quot;T.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:25.300" end="00:00:26.133">(makes &quot;t&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:26.133" end="00:00:27.367">(plays single beat)</p>
</div>
</body>
